@startuml
!theme toy
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10
title Standard Interface Process Flow

participant "ERP System" as ERP
participant "POS Headquarter" as POS_HQ
participant "POS Branch" as POS_Bch
participant "CRM System" as CRM

group 1. Master Data (End-Day/Schedule)
    ERP -> POS_HQ : 1.1 Product Master (Item, Barcode, UOM)
    ERP -> POS_HQ : 1.2 Price List & Promotion
    ERP -> POS_HQ : 1.3 Customer & Supplier Info
    POS_HQ --> ERP : Acknowledge Status
end

group 2. Inventory Management
    == Inbound (รับเข้า) ==
    ERP -> POS_Bch :Stock Balance (ถ้ามี)
    ERP -> POS_Bch : 2.1 Confirm Receive /Transfer In
    POS_Bch -> ERP  : 2.2 Transfer Request / Transfer Out
 
    == Outbound (ส่งออก/ปรับปรุง) ==
    POS_Bch -> ERP : 2.3 Adjust Stock / Return to Vendor
end

group 3. Sales & Finance (End-Day/Real-time)
    POS_Bch -> POS_HQ : 3.1 Sync Sales Transaction (ABB) + TAX(ถ้ามี)
    POS_HQ -> ERP : 3.2 Send Sales Invoice (A/R Invoice) + TAX(ถ้ามี)
    POS_HQ -> ERP : 3.3 Send Credit Note (Return/CN) + TAX(ถ้ามี)
    POS_HQ -> ERP : 3.4 Send Payment & Reconciliation
end

group 4. CRM & Loyalty (Real-time API)
    CRM --> POS_HQ : Member Register(ถ้ามี)
    CRM --> POS_HQ : Member Update (ถ้ามี)
    POS_Bch -> CRM : 4.1 Inquiry Member Profile
    CRM --> POS_Bch : Return Points & Tier
    POS_Bch -> CRM : 4.2 Earn Points (Sales)
    POS_Bch -> CRM : 4.3 Burn Points (Redemption)
    POS_Bch -> CRM : 4.4 Validate Coupon
    POS_Bch -> CRM : 4.5 Confirm Coupon
end

note right of ERP
  **Standard Protocol:**
  - File: CSV/XML/JSON (SFTP)
  - API: REST/SOAP
end note

note right of CRM
  **Security:**
  - OAuth 2.0 / API Key
  - TLS 1.2+
end note

@enduml
